# Exception: ARIA Sentinel product source ships recipe/build scripts as part of the desktop
# product; the whole tree is already force-404'd live (/ARIA Sentinel/*). Without these
# negations, new recipe scripts could never be committed again.
!ARIA Sentinel/**/*.ps1
!ARIA Sentinel/**/*.bat
!ARIA Sentinel/CLAUDE.md

# Local Sentinel build snapshots (dist.<ver>.<ts>/) — contain >100MB exes GitHub rejects (GH001).
# Build artifacts only; files stay on disk. Shipped installers live in downloads/.
ARIA Sentinel/dist.*/

